---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const articleSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      "@id": "https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/articles/mahindra-mahalunge-master-township-guide-2026/#article",
      "headline": "Mahindra Mahalunge: Complete Project Review, Pricing & PMRDA Infrastructure 2026",
      "description": "Exhaustive buyer review of Mahindra Mahalunge (Mahindra Rivenza). Discover the 13.46-acre master layout, PMRDA Town Planning Scheme 1 boulevards, 4-lane river bridge connectivity to Hinjewadi, and pricing starting ₹90 Lakhs*.",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Mahalunge Micro-Market Research Wing"
      },
      "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Mahindra Rivenza"
      },
      "datePublished": "2026-11-04",
      "dateModified": "2026-11-04"
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "@id": "https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/articles/mahindra-mahalunge-master-township-guide-2026/#faq",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the official name of the Mahindra Mahalunge project?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The official project name for Mahindra Mahalunge is Mahindra Rivenza, developed by Mahindra Lifespace Developers Limited across a 13.46-acre master land parcel (~₹3,500 Cr GDV) in Mahalunge / Baner Annexe, Pune."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Why is Mahindra Mahalunge considered the top investment in West Pune?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Mahindra Mahalunge anchors PMRDA Town Planning Scheme 1 with wide 36m DP roads, underground cabling, and direct 7-minute river bridge transit to Hinjewadi Phase 1. It offers strong 4.8% to 5.4% rental yields and entry pricing 42% lower than central Baner."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How does Mahindra Mahalunge compare with Godrej Hillside and VTP Blue Waters?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "While Godrej and VTP launched earlier phases in the township cluster, Mahindra Mahalunge provides lower residential density, 9+ acres of landscaped greens, 44,000+ sq.ft. clubhouse, Pre-Certified IGBC Gold sustainability, and Mahindra Group financial security."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---

<Layout
  title="Mahindra Mahalunge | Complete Project Review, Master Plan & Prices 2026"
  description="In-depth 2026 guide to Mahindra Mahalunge (Mahindra Rivenza). 13.46 acres, 2, 3 & 4 BHK residences starting ₹90L*, PMRDA infrastructure, RERA & price list."
  canonical="https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/articles/mahindra-mahalunge-master-township-guide-2026/"
  customSchema={articleSchema}
>
  <article class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-charcoal-950 text-stone-300">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
      
      <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
      <nav class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs font-mono text-stone-400">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <a href="/articles/" class="hover:text-gold-400 transition-colors">Articles</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-gold-400">Mahindra Mahalunge Master Guide</span>
      </nav>

      <!-- Header Section -->
      <header class="space-y-6 border-b border-white/10 pb-8">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gold-500/10 border border-gold-500/30 text-gold-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest font-mono">
          <span>Micro-Market Benchmark • Mahalunge Pune</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl text-stone-50 font-bold leading-tight">
          Mahindra Mahalunge: Complete Project Review, Pricing &amp; PMRDA Infrastructure 2026
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-300 font-light leading-relaxed">
          How <strong class="text-gold-400 font-medium">Mahindra Mahalunge</strong> (officially branded as <strong class="text-white font-medium">Mahindra Rivenza</strong>) is reshaping the West Pune growth corridor with 13.46 acres of biophilic design, direct river bridge access to Hinjewadi, and launch prices starting ₹90 Lakhs*.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-xs font-mono text-stone-400 pt-2">
          <span>PMRDA Town Planning Special</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>Updated November 2026</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>7 min read</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">MahaRERA: PR1261012602102 | PM1261012602103</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-stone-100 font-bold">
          PMRDA Town Planning Scheme 1: The Transformative Engine of Mahindra Mahalunge
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          When tech professionals and investors search for <strong class="text-gold-300 font-medium">Mahindra Mahalunge</strong>, they are focusing on one of Maharashtra’s most thoughtfully planned urban transformations. Mahalunge forms the flagship node of PMRDA Town Planning Scheme 1 (TPS 1). Unlike haphazard suburban developments, every road, utility line, and civic reservation here follows a ring-fenced master blueprint.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          <strong>Mahindra Mahalunge</strong> (Mahindra Rivenza) commands direct frontage along planned 36-meter wide Town Planning boulevards. These avenues incorporate dedicated cycle tracks, pedestrian footpaths, and underground utility conduits, ensuring that roads remain pristine without frequent post-monsoon trenching.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: Direct Hinjewadi Velocity -->
      <section class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-stone-100 font-bold">
          Direct Hinjewadi Velocity: 4-Lane River Bridge &amp; Pune Metro Line 3
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          The single greatest infrastructure milestone elevating <strong class="text-white font-medium">Mahindra Mahalunge</strong> is the newly operational 4-lane Mula River Bridge. Previously, commuters traveling between Mahalunge and Hinjewadi had to navigate cumbersome detours via Wakad or highway junctions. Today:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-center">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 space-y-1">
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-gold-400 font-mono">7 Mins</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-stone-300 block font-medium">To Infosys &amp; Wipro Gates</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-stone-500 font-mono">Via 4-Lane River Bridge</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 space-y-1">
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-gold-400 font-mono">8 Mins</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-stone-300 block font-medium">To Balewadi High Street</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-stone-500 font-mono">Cosmopolitan Dining Hub</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/10 space-y-1">
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-gold-400 font-mono">7 Mins</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-stone-300 block font-medium">To Metro Line 3 Station</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-stone-500 font-mono">Direct to Shivajinagar</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3: Comparative Analysis -->
      <section class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gold-500/30 space-y-6">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl text-stone-100 font-bold">
          Mahindra Mahalunge vs Godrej Hillside vs VTP Blue Waters
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-300 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Homebuyers evaluating <strong class="text-gold-300 font-medium">Mahindra Mahalunge</strong> frequently compare it with existing township projects in the Nande-Mahalunge belt. Here is the objective comparative benchmark:
        </p>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-left text-xs border border-white/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
            <thead class="bg-charcoal-900 text-gold-400 font-mono uppercase">
              <tr>
                <th class="p-3 border-b border-white/10">Evaluation Metric</th>
                <th class="p-3 border-b border-white/10">Mahindra Mahalunge (Rivenza)</th>
                <th class="p-3 border-b border-white/10">Godrej Hillside Cluster</th>
                <th class="p-3 border-b border-white/10">VTP Blue Waters Cluster</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-white/5 bg-charcoal-900/40">
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-stone-100">Land Parcel Scale</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-gold-300 font-medium">13.46 Acres Integrated Master Community</td>
                <td class="p-3">Sector within ~100-acre township</td>
                <td class="p-3">High-density mega township sector</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-stone-100">Open Greens Ratio</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-gold-300 font-medium">9+ Acres Biophilic Greens (68% Open)</td>
                <td class="p-3">Standard landscaped pocket gardens</td>
                <td class="p-3">Shared high-density township amenities</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-stone-100">Clubhouse Infrastructure</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-gold-300 font-medium">44,000+ Sq.Ft. Dedicated Multi-Level Facility</td>
                <td class="p-3">Sector-level clubhouse facilities</td>
                <td class="p-3">Cluster-level shared clubhouse</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-stone-100">Sustainability Norms</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-gold-300 font-medium">Pre-Certified IGBC Gold &amp; Net Zero Waste</td>
                <td class="p-3">IGBC Green Building standards</td>
                <td class="p-3">Standard statutory environmental norms</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-stone-100">Starting Price</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-emerald-400 font-bold">Starts ₹90 Lakhs* (Fresh Launch Advantage)</td>
                <td class="p-3">Mature resale / secondary asking rates</td>
                <td class="p-3">Similar entry ticket with higher density</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4: Configuration & Pricing -->
      <section class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-stone-100 font-bold">
          Configuration Breakdown at Mahindra Mahalunge
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-gold-300">Mahindra Mahalunge</strong> offers 9 MahaRERA-sanctioned architectural layouts across three core typology brackets:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm sm:text-base">
          <li class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="font-bold text-stone-100">2 BHK Residences (Premium &amp; Luxury)</span>
              <span class="text-gold-400 font-semibold font-mono">Starts ₹90 Lakhs*</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-400">
              635 to 747 sq.ft. RERA carpet area (688 to 855 sq.ft. aggregate usable area). Perfect for young IT professionals and starting families looking for high capital appreciation.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="font-bold text-stone-100">3 BHK Residences (Deluxe &amp; Ultra Luxury)</span>
              <span class="text-gold-400 font-semibold font-mono">Starts ₹1.31 Crore*</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-400">
              882 to 1,065 sq.ft. RERA carpet area (995 to 1,206 sq.ft. aggregate usable area). Features private master bedrooms, dual balconies, and acoustic study corners.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="font-bold text-stone-100">4 BHK Presidential Sky Villas</span>
              <span class="text-gold-400 font-semibold font-mono">Starts ₹2.20 Crore*</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-400">
              1,438 to 1,465 sq.ft. RERA carpet area (1,615 to 1,651 sq.ft. aggregate usable area). Expansive living-dining zones, wrap-around sundecks, and panoramic hillside vistas.
            </p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- FAQ Section -->
      <section class="space-y-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-stone-100 font-bold">
          Frequently Asked Questions About Mahindra Mahalunge
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/5 space-y-2">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-base font-semibold text-stone-100">
              Is Mahindra Mahalunge MahaRERA registered?
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-300 leading-relaxed font-light">
              Yes, Mahindra Mahalunge (Mahindra Rivenza) holds two official registrations with MahaRERA: Phase 1 (PR1261012602102) and Phase 2 (PM1261012602103), both valid through December 30, 2031.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/5 space-y-2">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-base font-semibold text-stone-100">
              How far is Mahindra Mahalunge from central Baner?
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-300 leading-relaxed font-light">
              Mahindra Mahalunge is located in Baner Annexe, approximately 3.8 km (8 to 10 minutes) from central Baner, offering immediate connectivity to Baner's commercial high streets, hospitals, and fine-dining restaurants while avoiding urban traffic bottlenecks.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA Footer -->
      <footer class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-500/10 via-charcoal-900 to-charcoal-950 border border-gold-500/30 text-center space-y-4">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl text-stone-50 font-bold">
          Get the Verified Mahindra Mahalunge Cost Sheet &amp; Brochure
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-300 max-w-xl mx-auto font-light">
          PropSmart Realty (MahaRERA Agent A031262401295) is the official authorized channel partner for Mahindra Mahalunge / Mahindra Rivenza.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="tel:+917744009295"
            class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-gold-500 text-charcoal-950 font-semibold text-xs tracking-wider uppercase hover:bg-gold-400 transition-colors"
          >
            Call Advisory: +91 7744009295
          </a>
          <a
            href="/brochure/"
            class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/10 text-stone-200 font-semibold text-xs tracking-wider uppercase hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors"
          >
            Download PDF Brochure
          </a>
        </div>
      </footer>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
